湯後就毀了這細緻的湯頭。有時候太細緻的湯頭配料真的要好好選且拿捏好量，不然很可惜。\n\n肉有幾片後切的邊角不好咬，片的部分偏厚但是口感也還好，至少干貝就正常表現。\n\n雲吞很大一塊，不吃蝦可以換純豬肉的版本，我自己有換。\nNG蛋15塊，是沒調味的，但是溏心是會流心的液狀，我覺得沒NG，唯一NG應該就是醃製調味吧?!\n\n整體來說是有用心的一間店，因為我不吃蝦目前評價最多人推的是蝦湯，這就給其他麵友來試試看。\n\n不過附近強店家林立，尤其平價超CP的道樂三重就在附近，我覺得賣這樣價格會有點辛苦。店家後續也有更改菜單多了平日平價款的部分因應外，就看後續市場的接受度了。",null,[0,68]]]],[null,1754524794000000,1754524794000000,"1 年前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfYlhrZnJIeVAzSHFDbXowQU5hVDlyZw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiLwoZQ0hfYlhrZnJIeVAzSHFDbXowQU5hVDlyZxoSQ2dzSS10alB4QVlRLS1IOVNn\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwi_rOarydKWAxVmla8BHS5LM0EQ_2MIgQEoDg"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1201051210675199503/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQ0UlZSSFNrdGhWVkY0VFhwb1IxbFlUazVQUjJnMFlVZDBiMVZyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1201051210675199503/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQ0UlZSSFNrdGhWVkY0VFhwb1IxbFlUazVQUjJnMFlVZDBiMVZyUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1201051210675199503/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQ0UlZSSFNrdGhWVkY0VFhwb1IxbFlUazVQUjJnMFlVZDBiMVZyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1201051210675199503/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQ0UlZSSFNrdGhWVkY0VFhwb1IxbFlUazVQUjJnMFlVZDBiMVZyUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1201051210675199503/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQ0UlZSSFNrdGhWVkY0VFhwb1IxbFlUazVQUjJnMFlVZDBiMVZyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1201051210675199503/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQ0UlZSSFNrdGhWVkY0VFhwb1IxbFlUazVQUjJnMFlVZDBiMVZyUlJBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["謝謝您用心的給與我們建議及評論，深深感激。\n給我們店家的一些提點都非常的受用，希望您能再次蒞臨，品嚐我們調整過後的拉麵哦\n謝謝您\n",null,[0,65]]]],[null,null,4727,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUl